  "name": "BANK NIFTY IronFly 500pt Hedge (Current Week)",
  "description": "\n<p><strong>BANK NIFTY IronFly 500pt Hedge (Current Week)</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Strategy Notes & Trading Intent:</strong></p>\n<p>--------------------------------------------------</p>\n<p>1. <strong>Entry Criteria:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Underlying:</strong> BANK NIFTY Index (Current Week Expiry Spreads).</li>\n  <li><strong>Entry Time:</strong> At 3:15 PM IST (15:15 IST).</li>\n  <li><strong>Trigger Condition:</strong> Enters 4-leg Iron Fly position on BANK NIFTY (Sell ATM Call & Put, Buy 500pt OTM Call & Put protective hedges) at 15:15 IST.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>2. <strong>Exit Criteria & Risk Parameters:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Universal Exit:</strong> Square off all intraday open positions at 3:15 PM IST.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>3. <strong>Additional Mechanics:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n  <li>Protective hedges placed 500 points away, rolling outward by 100 points on hedge boundary crosses.</li>\n</ul>\n",
